| 🟡 Medium | No security logging | A09 | `morgan` + structured audit events |
| 🟡 Medium | `listen()` in module body | — | Separate `server.js` entry point |

**Immediate priorities:** rotate the credentials in `.env.test`, add `helmet()`, and gate the `/users` endpoint behind authentication. Everything else should follow before the application handles any real traffic.

